# Firebase Android client config. Google formally treats this as non-secret
# (it ships inside the APK), but it embeds a Google API key, so it is kept
# out of Git as defense in depth -- consistent with this repo's handling of
# every other credential-bearing file. Local `expo run:android` reads it
# from this path via app.config.ts's android.googleServicesFile. EAS Build
# supplies it through the file-type GOOGLE_SERVICES_JSON environment variable.
google-services.json
